WEBVTT

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:03.430
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.520
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime</i>

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>Minna ga neshizumatta yoru
In the night when everyone else was lost in their sleep...</i>

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.620
<i>Mado kara sora wo miru to
I looked at the sky through the window...</i>

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:23.540
<i>Tottemo sugoi mono wo mita n' da
...and there I saw such a great thing!</i>

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.840
<i>Otona wa dare mo warai-nagara
All the adults told me with a great big laugh...</i>

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.340
<i>Terebi no misugi to iu kedo
"You've been watching way too much television again!"</i>

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.920
<i>Boku wa zettai ni zettai ni
But I would never, ever...</i>

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.140
<i>Uso nanka itte 'nai
...tell any kind of lie!</i>

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:45.520
<i>Joushiki to iu megane de
This world of ours...</i>

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:51.020
<i>Boku-tachi no sekai wa
...cannot be viewed through...</i>

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>Nozokeya shinai no sa
...the glasses of common sense.</i>

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>Yume wo wasureta
You old earthlings...</i>

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.830
<i>furui chikyuu-jin yo
...who have forgotten your dreams!</i>

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>Anime Ja Nai! Anime Ja Nai!
It's not Anime! It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.330
<i>Fushigi na kimochi
Such a wonderful feeling!</i>

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.420
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.840
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:20.140
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:25.020
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:32.870 --> 00:01:36.960
HOT-BLOODED MASHYMRE

00:01:52.980 --> 00:01:55.390
That's it, Argama!
Keep moving back like that.

00:02:16.420 --> 00:02:17.370
Don't fall apart on us!

00:02:21.710 --> 00:02:23.510
Are you okay, Chimatter?

00:02:23.510 --> 00:02:25.420
Yeah... Somehow.

00:02:29.760 --> 00:02:32.850
Are we any better hidden
now than before? Chimatter?

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:36.350
Give it two or three more
gentle shakes of the hull, please.

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:38.270
That should
completely hide you.

00:02:38.270 --> 00:02:40.730
Gentle, huh?
Can you do it, Caesar?

00:02:40.730 --> 00:02:43.150
Gently?

00:02:43.730 --> 00:02:46.110
I'm not Mr. Saegusa, so...

00:02:59.580 --> 00:03:03.420
Early day for you I see, sir.
Will that be cash or credit card?

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:06.420
Sorry, but I have neither
a card nor cash on me.

00:03:06.420 --> 00:03:07.590
Oh?

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:11.680
Keep the change.

00:03:13.140 --> 00:03:15.220
Good morning, Master Mashymre!

00:03:15.220 --> 00:03:16.430
And what of the Argama?

00:03:16.680 --> 00:03:19.650
It seems it's been wandering around
those junk heaps since last night.

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:22.520
I should go and
inspect the colony.

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:23.940
Go back!

00:03:24.110 --> 00:03:24.690
Why, sir?

00:03:25.320 --> 00:03:27.820
Because coming here
dressed in that manner...

00:03:27.820 --> 00:03:30.450
is interfering
with my mission!

00:03:30.450 --> 00:03:31.620
Master Mashymre!

00:03:43.290 --> 00:03:45.460
The Argama may be
shifting its position.

00:03:46.090 --> 00:03:48.170
Are you going
to check that out?

00:03:48.630 --> 00:03:52.510
I dispatched some
scouts to deal with it.

00:03:52.510 --> 00:03:55.720
I'm hoping we can take the
Argama without spilling any blood,

00:03:55.720 --> 00:03:58.520
as you ordered,
Master Mashymre.

00:03:58.520 --> 00:04:01.900
But there's something else
I'd like to show you.

00:04:02.190 --> 00:04:03.230
To me?

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:06.480
Yes, sir.
Sorry to take up your time, sir.

00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:07.860
It's all right.

00:04:14.910 --> 00:04:18.410
I would prefer to obtain the Argama
without any bloodshed.

00:04:18.410 --> 00:04:21.290
Besides, if I see the various
sights of this colony,

00:04:21.290 --> 00:04:24.840
I can be of use to Lady Haman when she
takes over the Earth Sphere's government.

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:29.010
You are the chosen youths who have
pledged themselves to the Zabi family!

00:04:29.130 --> 00:04:32.630
You shall become my eyes
to observe the Earth Sphere,

00:04:32.630 --> 00:04:36.050
and then act in my stead
to make it the Zabi family's!

00:04:38.720 --> 00:04:40.020
Mashymre Cello!

00:04:40.180 --> 00:04:41.520
My lady!

00:04:49.480 --> 00:04:51.610
I have high hopes for you.

00:04:51.610 --> 00:04:53.360
My lady.

00:04:55.200 --> 00:04:59.240
For that reason, I'm assigning you
to Shangri-La, the historic first colony.

00:04:59.910 --> 00:05:03.250
Scout it thoroughly and establish
a stronghold for us there.

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:07.210
Lady Haman, I swear I shall
fulfill your expectations.

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:20.810
Stay awake while you're driving!

00:05:20.810 --> 00:05:23.020
This is what happens when you
don't pay attention to the lights!

00:05:23.640 --> 00:05:25.940
You're the one who ran it!
YOU should pay attention!

00:05:26.350 --> 00:05:27.230
What?!

00:05:27.230 --> 00:05:29.400
Beecha, we don't have
time to fool around here!

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:30.610
But...!

00:05:30.610 --> 00:05:32.030
Sorry, old man!

00:05:32.110 --> 00:05:34.530
What do you mean "old man"?!

00:05:35.530 --> 00:05:36.910
What little monsters!

00:05:36.910 --> 00:05:39.580
No. Our job is to educate
children like that...

00:05:39.580 --> 00:05:42.000
and give them
a dream to follow.

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:44.120
High-spirited children
are a resource in war.

00:05:44.120 --> 00:05:45.620
I suppose.

00:05:48.630 --> 00:05:51.130
Good morning! Any milk left?

00:05:51.130 --> 00:05:54.010
Good morning, Leina!
I saved some for you.

00:05:54.010 --> 00:05:55.930
Great!
It's been three days.

00:05:56.010 --> 00:05:58.220
An errand before school...
It must be tough for you.

00:05:58.220 --> 00:06:00.100
You've been selling
out so fast, lately.

00:06:00.100 --> 00:06:03.560
Sorry. It seems like the
supplies are going to the port...

00:06:03.560 --> 00:06:05.520
and the hospital in District 10.

00:06:05.520 --> 00:06:06.850
In District 10?

00:06:06.900 --> 00:06:08.400
Hey, Leina!

00:06:08.810 --> 00:06:09.730
Morning!

00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:10.610
Good morning, Leina!

00:06:10.650 --> 00:06:12.320
You're gonna skip
school again, aren't you?!

00:06:12.820 --> 00:06:14.400
We'll go after
we're done working!

00:06:14.530 --> 00:06:17.200
Liar! And don't drag
my brother into this!

00:06:18.820 --> 00:06:22.700
Judau, wake up!
I found out where the Argama is!

00:06:22.700 --> 00:06:24.500
Huh? What did you say?

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:26.620
Stop that!

00:06:26.620 --> 00:06:28.210
Oh? Am I embarrassing you?

00:06:28.330 --> 00:06:29.920
Just get dressed!

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:31.340
Hey, what are you doing?!

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:33.510
You're the one who
told us to hurry, right?

00:06:33.510 --> 00:06:35.920
If you take your sweet time,
the Argama's gonna get away!

00:06:35.920 --> 00:06:39.590
Iino! Would you quit yelling to the
whole world about the Argama!

00:06:39.720 --> 00:06:40.800
Sorry.

00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:42.510
Now I'm the one
getting yelled at!

00:06:42.510 --> 00:06:43.520
Right, right.

00:06:45.310 --> 00:06:46.100
All set!

00:06:46.230 --> 00:06:46.810
Okay.

00:06:46.810 --> 00:06:49.230
Big Brother!

00:06:49.230 --> 00:06:51.400
Here comes trouble.

00:06:51.400 --> 00:06:52.400
Where are you going?

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:53.320
I dunno.

00:06:53.320 --> 00:06:54.780
You're going to
the Argama, aren't you?!

00:06:54.820 --> 00:06:57.950
Elle heard it's in junk block 4.

00:06:58.320 --> 00:06:59.700
Don't you dare go!

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:01.200
Hey, Beecha. Get going.

00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:02.910
Okay.

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:05.330
Wait! Come on, wait!

00:07:05.370 --> 00:07:07.250
I'll bring you a mobile
suit as a souvenir!

00:07:07.710 --> 00:07:11.130
Oh...! I have to do something!

00:07:11.130 --> 00:07:13.710
Miss Fa might know what to do!

00:07:20.430 --> 00:07:22.010
That hospital?

00:07:22.010 --> 00:07:24.510
What interest do I have
in such a filthy place?

00:07:24.510 --> 00:07:27.520
The Argama's wounded
are being treated there.

00:07:27.520 --> 00:07:32.110
I promised the hospital that we'd
make a donation, so if we use that...

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:34.520
You mean make hostages
of their wounded?

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:38.110
Not hostages! Shields!

00:07:38.110 --> 00:07:39.700
Unacceptable! Take us back!

00:07:41.360 --> 00:07:42.870
I won't resort to
such cowardly tricks...!

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:47.200
Look out!

00:07:50.210 --> 00:07:51.920
Fa!

00:07:56.500 --> 00:08:01.300
What compassion... Shielding her
patient with her own body.

00:08:01.300 --> 00:08:03.010
The very image of
an angel in white.

00:08:05.510 --> 00:08:07.100
You're not injured, are you?

00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:08.600
I... I'm fine.

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:11.310
If there's anything
I could do to help...

00:08:11.310 --> 00:08:14.310
Thank you, but he's
not a difficult patient.

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:15.820
He can't walk?

00:08:15.820 --> 00:08:17.400
Kamille can walk!

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:20.700
He just doesn't understand anything
anymore because of the war.

00:08:21.110 --> 00:08:24.620
A victim of the war?
Your work is appreciated, Nurse.

00:08:25.030 --> 00:08:26.700
I'm not a nurse.

00:08:26.700 --> 00:08:28.620
You're his sister, then?

00:08:28.700 --> 00:08:29.540
His girlfriend!

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:36.800
Well, everyone here is lucky
to have a person like you!

00:08:36.800 --> 00:08:38.510
I'm sorry, but I really...

00:08:38.510 --> 00:08:41.300
Your prudence against others
is part of your refinement.

00:08:41.420 --> 00:08:42.800
You are truly an angel!

00:08:42.800 --> 00:08:45.430
Miss Fa!
I've been looking for you!

00:08:45.430 --> 00:08:48.810
Leina?
Pardon me. Let's go.

00:08:49.470 --> 00:08:50.770
Um... Miss Angel!

00:08:53.600 --> 00:08:56.400
A flower blooming
amidst the slums.

00:08:56.820 --> 00:09:00.490
This mad society has
driven her to tragedy.

00:09:00.780 --> 00:09:03.700
I can see only a dark future for her.

00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:13.330
Huh?

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:15.830
Hey! Where the hell
is the Argama?

00:09:15.830 --> 00:09:17.710
I'm sure it was there.

00:09:17.710 --> 00:09:20.260
What are you looking at?
I don't see it anywhere.

00:09:20.920 --> 00:09:23.930
The enemy doesn't move
the way we want it to!

00:09:23.930 --> 00:09:26.220
Seeing where they
went was your job, Elle!

00:09:26.220 --> 00:09:27.720
We just have to find it.

00:09:28.720 --> 00:09:29.600
Wait!

00:09:32.810 --> 00:09:35.020
Why did you get
so many people?

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:38.440
We're having them do this work
so we can gather people without suspicion.

00:09:38.770 --> 00:09:40.730
The truth is we've planted
bombs under here.

00:09:40.730 --> 00:09:42.610
When we lead the enemy here,
it'll become a pitfall.

00:09:43.110 --> 00:09:44.400
A pitfall?

00:09:44.400 --> 00:09:48.200
That will damage the colony!
A plan like that is too--

00:09:48.200 --> 00:09:50.040
Doing it here won't harm the city.

00:09:50.490 --> 00:09:52.000
I am a knight!

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:53.500
And there's the mobile suit.

00:09:54.620 --> 00:09:56.880
In that pile of liquor crates?

00:09:58.000 --> 00:10:01.800
We brought it here concealed
in them to avoid scaring people.

00:10:02.300 --> 00:10:03.720
But why liquor crates?!

00:10:03.800 --> 00:10:06.720
Couldn't you have hidden it
under roses or something?

00:10:07.010 --> 00:10:09.010
Who's that guy?

00:10:09.140 --> 00:10:11.600
Shh! That's...!

00:10:11.600 --> 00:10:14.520
The Argama's moving
to block 2, up ahead.

00:10:14.520 --> 00:10:15.730
Ooh!

00:10:16.100 --> 00:10:20.110
Gottn! Rendezvous with the recon team
and wait for me to make contact.

00:10:20.230 --> 00:10:22.110
I'll head for the Argama in the Galluss.

00:10:22.110 --> 00:10:22.730
Yes, sir!

00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:31.200
He's after the Argama, too!
We can't let him beat us to it!

00:10:31.330 --> 00:10:33.700
Elle, tell Beecha and the others!

00:10:33.700 --> 00:10:35.210
What about you?

00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:37.080
I'll slow 'em down.
Now hurry!

00:10:48.010 --> 00:10:49.010
A mobile suit!

00:11:01.820 --> 00:11:03.820
The one from last night.

00:11:17.620 --> 00:11:18.710
All right! Whoa!

00:11:19.250 --> 00:11:21.500
Agh! Whoa! Ow! Ow!

00:11:25.300 --> 00:11:27.510
Is that how he's
planning to steal the Zeta?

00:11:27.510 --> 00:11:28.510
You got me.

00:11:28.510 --> 00:11:32.350
Beecha! Don't just stand there!
We have to help him!

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:35.470
The truck my brother
and the others were in!

00:11:38.520 --> 00:11:40.650
They've totally stopped
at the wrong place.

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:45.820
You okay, Leina?

00:11:46.030 --> 00:11:47.440
Yeah.

00:11:49.030 --> 00:11:52.410
Um, sorry. Shinta, Qum,
can you get behind and push?

00:11:54.700 --> 00:11:55.700
Let's go!

00:11:58.040 --> 00:11:59.870
Ah! The truck's leaving!

00:12:16.100 --> 00:12:18.220
They finally got
the hatch put on.

00:12:20.310 --> 00:12:23.230
The Endra's mechanics
aren't bad, are they?

00:12:24.650 --> 00:12:26.820
Hm? It won't close?

00:12:31.030 --> 00:12:32.490
Maybe the manual...

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:39.450
Hm? Who was that?

00:12:40.910 --> 00:12:46.420
Hm? That's camera 21,
on the left rear.

00:12:48.630 --> 00:12:50.010
What?!

00:12:50.010 --> 00:12:51.720
That's right behind me.

00:12:53.220 --> 00:12:55.800
A thief? Have I seen him
somewhere before?

00:13:05.020 --> 00:13:08.940
Hey, you! The kid on my back!
Get off! You're going to get hurt!

00:13:09.480 --> 00:13:11.360
Like I'm going to get off
after coming this far?!

00:13:11.860 --> 00:13:15.200
I know you're a child of
lower character, but-- Whoa!

00:13:16.950 --> 00:13:18.410
But stop fooling around!

00:13:18.620 --> 00:13:21.830
You think I'd do something this
dangerous just to fool around?!

00:13:21.910 --> 00:13:23.370
Why, then?

00:13:23.410 --> 00:13:25.750
I take mobile suits
apart and sell them!

00:13:25.750 --> 00:13:27.290
So I'm gonna stop you!

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:28.420
Are you serious?!

00:13:28.420 --> 00:13:29.420
Yes!

00:13:29.420 --> 00:13:31.340
What an awful child!

00:13:32.220 --> 00:13:33.510
Don't blame me if you get hurt!

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:38.850
Hey! Are you ready to do it?

00:13:39.220 --> 00:13:42.520
Yeah! Elle, hurry up and
fill those bottles with sand!

00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:44.520
I'm doing it! Jeez!

00:13:50.610 --> 00:13:53.530
All right, Judau!
He's really hanging in there!

00:13:53.530 --> 00:13:55.610
Move in to the side!
Right or left.

00:13:55.610 --> 00:13:56.320
Okay!

00:13:56.740 --> 00:13:59.240
Come on! Fall! Fall! Fall!

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:07.960
Hey, Judau!

00:14:08.460 --> 00:14:09.540
What?

00:14:11.050 --> 00:14:12.340
Here we go!

00:14:14.050 --> 00:14:14.630
What?!

00:14:18.970 --> 00:14:20.470
So close! Almost got him!

00:14:20.560 --> 00:14:22.930
Don't stop now!
Keep shooting!

00:14:23.270 --> 00:14:25.440
What foul children!

00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:27.730
Child! Are you making
fun of an adult?!

00:14:27.730 --> 00:14:30.110
I'm not making fun of anyone!
I'm dead serious here!

00:14:30.440 --> 00:14:31.400
What?!

00:14:31.400 --> 00:14:32.230
Get out!

00:14:32.230 --> 00:14:33.940
What are you...?!

00:14:33.940 --> 00:14:35.150
My eyes are still stinging!

00:14:35.150 --> 00:14:36.150
Like I care?!

00:14:36.240 --> 00:14:37.450
You cowardly little...!

00:14:38.450 --> 00:14:41.450
All right!
Judau made it into the cockpit!

00:14:44.830 --> 00:14:46.790
You may be a child,
but I won't forgive this!

00:14:49.670 --> 00:14:52.050
I'll knock you off of here!

00:14:58.050 --> 00:14:59.140
What?! Why, you...!

00:14:59.140 --> 00:15:00.970
- Fall!
- No, YOU fall!

00:15:02.010 --> 00:15:02.850
Judau!

00:15:03.220 --> 00:15:04.600
Take that! Fall!

00:15:04.600 --> 00:15:06.310
Like hell!

00:15:06.770 --> 00:15:09.150
Down a little! Closer!
Judau, this way!

00:15:09.150 --> 00:15:11.150
Knock him off if you can!

00:15:11.940 --> 00:15:13.730
No, you DON'T!

00:15:15.360 --> 00:15:16.860
Judau!

00:15:27.870 --> 00:15:30.750
Some things are unforgivable,
even when done by children!

00:15:30.750 --> 00:15:32.000
I will punish them for this!

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:33.380
Mashymre.

00:15:34.210 --> 00:15:36.960
I hear that the society of
the older colonies is crumbling.

00:15:38.050 --> 00:15:43.550
The children may be warped
by it, but they are society's victims.

00:15:44.140 --> 00:15:48.480
We must watch over them and
show them even more affection.

00:15:49.770 --> 00:15:52.060
It's just as Lady Haman says.

00:15:53.560 --> 00:15:57.400
The only way to correct this
is to defeat the Argama...

00:15:57.400 --> 00:16:00.280
and then clean up
this colony myself.

00:16:09.750 --> 00:16:11.750
Kill that light! They'll find us!

00:16:18.340 --> 00:16:19.920
I think it's going
to collapse.

00:16:19.920 --> 00:16:22.090
If you worry about it,
it really will fall on us!

00:16:33.860 --> 00:16:35.440
I don't think they're coming.

00:16:35.900 --> 00:16:38.440
No, just wait a bit longer.

00:16:39.400 --> 00:16:40.450
Yes?

00:16:40.450 --> 00:16:42.950
What?!
Emergency hatch #2 is open?

00:16:42.950 --> 00:16:43.820
The enemy?

00:16:43.820 --> 00:16:45.620
No, sir.
It looks like it's the kids.

00:16:46.030 --> 00:16:49.620
Okay, seal off corridors 11 and 12.
Lead them here.

00:16:49.790 --> 00:16:50.910
Aye, aye!

00:16:51.040 --> 00:16:54.000
I knew they'd come.
From below this time...

00:16:58.130 --> 00:17:01.470
Hey, it's a mobile suit hangar.
Looks like no one's around.

00:17:02.550 --> 00:17:04.260
Damn, it's a trap!

00:17:05.470 --> 00:17:06.970
Guys!

00:17:08.060 --> 00:17:09.560
Where's the Zeta?

00:17:09.640 --> 00:17:11.640
There! On the upper deck!

00:17:17.190 --> 00:17:18.770
- Stop it, you perv!
- Calm down!

00:17:19.530 --> 00:17:21.820
He's headed for the Zeta!
Stop him!

00:17:23.820 --> 00:17:25.740
You again! Stop the crane!

00:17:26.030 --> 00:17:28.080
Whoa! Alley-oop!

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:32.960
Once I get inside, it's mine!

00:17:40.960 --> 00:17:42.920
He did it!
Way to go, Judau!

00:17:48.180 --> 00:17:48.800
Huh?

00:17:53.940 --> 00:17:56.690
What?!
That guy from before is here?

00:17:57.730 --> 00:17:58.440
What is it?!

00:17:58.440 --> 00:18:00.650
The enemy! One mobile suit!

00:18:00.650 --> 00:18:02.690
Prepare to send out
the Methuss. Where's Fa?

00:18:02.740 --> 00:18:03.950
Still not back!

00:18:03.950 --> 00:18:05.360
Take the kids to the bridge!

00:18:05.740 --> 00:18:09.910
I can't let you take the Zeta
after all I did to get in here!

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:12.290
Zeta... GO!!!

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:20.840
Huh? The hatch closed
and the monitor switched on.

00:18:20.840 --> 00:18:24.050
Cool! A 360-degree monitor!

00:18:25.050 --> 00:18:28.340
If that's how you choose to
face me, you'll be an easy opponent!

00:18:35.850 --> 00:18:37.140
He's running?

00:18:37.140 --> 00:18:39.650
I won't let you break it after
what I went through to get it!

00:18:39.650 --> 00:18:40.570
Huh?

00:18:41.690 --> 00:18:45.030
It's cowardly to run!
Face me properly!

00:18:47.240 --> 00:18:49.570
You won't even defend
your own ship?!

00:18:52.830 --> 00:18:57.670
No. Using my rifle will invite
civilian casualties. However...!

00:19:00.250 --> 00:19:02.090
That stubborn...!
He's still after me?!

00:19:03.920 --> 00:19:07.010
There's no choice.
Gottn! We're using the pitfall!

00:19:07.340 --> 00:19:09.260
You're using it, sir?

00:19:09.260 --> 00:19:12.430
I'll lure him there!
Be ready to fill in the hole!

00:19:12.430 --> 00:19:13.140
Sir!

00:19:13.720 --> 00:19:15.850
This may violate the spirit of chivalry,

00:19:15.850 --> 00:19:18.810
but it's for the betterment of society!
En garde!

00:19:24.570 --> 00:19:25.530
Now!

00:19:32.410 --> 00:19:33.330
A pitfall!

00:19:33.330 --> 00:19:34.040
Gotcha!

00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:40.540
What?!

00:19:42.960 --> 00:19:45.550
Master Mashymre,
your hatch is still open!

00:19:45.630 --> 00:19:47.760
What?! Close!

00:19:55.310 --> 00:19:57.730
We're gonna
fight in space, huh?

00:19:57.730 --> 00:19:58.810
Hey! Do you read me?

00:19:59.480 --> 00:20:02.730
Switch on your autobalancer.
It's to your right.

00:20:02.730 --> 00:20:06.150
That'll let you maneuver with the
control sticks. Can you handle it?

00:20:06.150 --> 00:20:06.980
Huh?!

00:20:11.990 --> 00:20:12.820
He dodged!

00:20:13.320 --> 00:20:15.330
You expect me to fight like this?!

00:20:15.330 --> 00:20:16.290
Calm down!

00:20:16.620 --> 00:20:18.040
You can do this.

00:20:18.040 --> 00:20:21.330
Huh? A red light
just turned on. It says "air. "

00:20:21.330 --> 00:20:24.670
Your air's leaking out!
Get back here at once!

00:20:25.290 --> 00:20:27.840
We can't let them have the Zeta.
Where's the Methuss?!

00:20:27.840 --> 00:20:31.840
Ready to go, but it'll take time
to send it out through the space port.

00:20:31.840 --> 00:20:33.640
Can't it just go through the same hole?

00:20:42.020 --> 00:20:43.650
You can't keep beating me!

00:20:43.650 --> 00:20:46.690
You've been lucky till now!
Do you think you can defeat me?

00:20:50.360 --> 00:20:52.200
With this blow,
I change the future!

00:20:52.610 --> 00:20:55.870
It's no good.
I'm running out of air.

00:20:55.950 --> 00:20:57.120
Hey! Hang in there!

00:20:57.240 --> 00:20:58.240
Judau!

00:20:58.240 --> 00:21:00.160
Wake up, Judau!

00:21:06.250 --> 00:21:07.800
You still resist?

00:21:09.340 --> 00:21:10.840
I won't be beaten!

00:21:18.220 --> 00:21:19.350
He did it!

00:21:19.350 --> 00:21:20.220
He really did!

00:21:20.220 --> 00:21:21.640
He did it, Captain!

00:21:21.640 --> 00:21:22.640
Yeah.

00:21:22.640 --> 00:21:24.730
Okay, someone's picking you up shortly.

00:21:24.730 --> 00:21:25.900
Just sit tight till then.

00:21:26.360 --> 00:21:29.860
You're taking the Zeta
from me again? This sucks!

00:21:30.110 --> 00:21:31.650
So, I get nothing,
after all that?

00:21:31.650 --> 00:21:33.900
I'll give you breakfast.

00:21:33.950 --> 00:21:37.030
Now shut up and come back here.
Or would you rather suffocate?

00:21:37.370 --> 00:21:39.410
Okay, just hurry up!

00:21:39.740 --> 00:21:41.830
Master Mashymre,
are you all right?

00:21:41.830 --> 00:21:44.750
I'm coming back in
through the pitfall.

00:21:44.750 --> 00:21:47.080
But we're already
sealing the hole, sir.

00:21:47.380 --> 00:21:49.630
What?! Stop it at once!

00:21:49.630 --> 00:21:54.260
The man's an imbecile.
No wonder I'm at a disadvantage!

00:21:57.430 --> 00:21:58.640
We did it!

00:21:58.640 --> 00:21:59.850
Let's hurry, Leina!

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:00.430
Right!

00:22:06.650 --> 00:22:08.110
Oh! Isn't that...?

00:22:12.990 --> 00:22:14.900
The angel.

00:22:17.240 --> 00:22:18.820
Should I stop, sir?

00:22:18.820 --> 00:22:21.240
No. Never mind.

00:22:21.950 --> 00:22:24.620
My base desires may
have led to my failure.

00:22:25.370 --> 00:22:30.290
Lady Haman, I swear
I will build the future that you desire.

00:22:45.850 --> 00:22:51.520
<i>michi mo nai areta genya ni
Amidst the wasteland without any roads...</i>

00:22:53.030 --> 00:22:58.740
<i>reeru wo tsukuru no wa kurushii koto sa
...it's difficult to lay down your rails.</i>

00:23:00.950 --> 00:23:03.240
<i>dakedo
However...</i>

00:23:03.240 --> 00:23:09.540
<i>tooi mukou mo shiranakucha ikenai
You've gotta know what's on the other side...</i>

00:23:09.540 --> 00:23:16.630
<i>boku-tachi wa kore kara nanda
...it's all from here on for us.</i>

00:23:16.630 --> 00:23:21.050
<i>"yume wo wasureta kodomo-tachi" to
"Children will forget their dreams"...</i>

00:23:21.050 --> 00:23:23.430
<i>hito wa iu
...is what they say.</i>

00:23:26.350 --> 00:23:33.650
<i>aa jidai ga naiteiru
Ah, the times are crying.</i>

00:23:48.690 --> 00:23:51.690
This guy Gemon has a bad
rep among us junk dealers.

00:23:51.690 --> 00:23:54.240
And now he's made
Mashymre his ally!

00:23:54.360 --> 00:23:57.570
Fa's not doing well
because Kamille's not doing well.

00:23:57.570 --> 00:24:02.870
In the end, I have to go out,
but the Zeta's on the blink again!

00:24:02.870 --> 00:24:05.200
What a pain in the rear!

00:24:05.200 --> 00:24:09.000
Next time, on Gundam ZZ:
"Judau's Decision."

00:24:09.000 --> 00:24:11.380
Heh-heh...
That makes me sound kinda cool.

00:24:09.670 --> 00:24:12.800
Next Time

00:24:09.670 --> 00:24:12.800
JUDAU'S DECISION
